- "Your instrumentation doubled CPU." â€” `async_hooks` `init`/`destroy` on every async resource; the fix is a sampling strategy, a cheaper mechanism, or `diagnostics_channel` with an actual subscriber.
- "Why is my `Map` in `init` growing without bound?" â€” no `destroy`, or the `Map` is in a different realm/module instance.

